{"series":{"id":"shattering-galaxy","slug":"shattering-galaxy","title":"Shattering Galaxy","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-08/bsc%201_001_5990.png?itok=Sobr8dLs","synopsis":"Buscando a sus padres, el joven de la montaña Jiang Han se embarca en un viaje de cultivo. ¡Accidentalmente activa el Caldero de la Bestia Celestial, un legado dejado por su madre, y despierta poderes mágicos supremos! A partir de entonces, desafía al destino y cambia su destino. Lucha contra el cielo y la tierra. En el campo de batalla donde cayeron los dioses, libra sangrientas batallas contra innumerables razas, ¡labrando un camino hacia los cielos con su cuerpo mortal! Promete luchar por un futuro brillante para la humanidad.","status":"En Emisión","year":2025,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/shattering-galaxy"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:33:42.542Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"shattering-galaxy-t1","slug":"shattering-galaxy-t1","seriesId":"shattering-galaxy","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-08/bsc%201_001_5990.png?itok=Sobr8dLs","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:33:42.543Z","episodeCount":50}],"episodes":[{"id":"shattering-galaxy-t1-e60","slug":"shattering-galaxy-t1-e60","title":"shattering-galaxy-1-episodio-x60","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/shattering-galaxy-1-episodio-x60","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v74a754/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k61qM8jjrOLuz6F23B8","embed":true}],"seriesId":"shattering-galaxy","seasonId":"shattering-galaxy-t1","number":60,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T18:39:41.999Z"},{"id":"shattering-galaxy-t1-e58","slug":"shattering-galaxy-t1-e58","title":"shattering-galaxy-1-episodio-x58","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/shattering-galaxy-1-episodio-x58","servers":[{"name":"rumble.co